Welcome to the RAVLIN live session!

  * install RAVLIN to disk:  void-installer
    (interactive console installer: keyboard, locale, timezone, users,
    partitioning, bootloader — it walks you through everything)

  * networking: dhcpcd and wpa_supplicant are running; wifi can be
    configured from the installer's Network menu

  * this session runs the fish shell: `help`, or `man fish`

RAVLIN is a minimal remix of Void Linux. https://www.voidlinux.org
